    "kind": "definition_of_done",
    "summary": "- Period boundaries come from the anchor (`StartedAt`, or `TrialEnd` for trials), so they no longer drift after short months. Jan 31 gives Feb 28, Mar 31, Apr 30, and a Feb 29 yearly anchor gives Feb 28 / Feb 29.\n- `RenewDue` renews every period that has started by now, in order, each with its own invoice, so a job that runs two months late produces the same periods as one that runs on time.\n- `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` pass, with new tests in `internal/billing` and `internal/subscriptions` covering month-end, leap-year, catch-up and metered cases.",
